@startuml documents_model_v7
title Documents — Django domain model v7\nSemantic HTML artifact · tag-typed Node index · PageRegion geometry · word-level confidence, aggregated everywhere

hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 270

legend right
  **UML → Django mapping**
  filled diamond .... FK on_delete=CASCADE
  solid arrow ....... FK on_delete=PROTECT
  dashed arrow ...... FK on_delete=SET_NULL, null=True
  package ........... aggregate: swaps as one unit
  --
  FK columns are drawn as edges, not fields.
  All offsets are GLOBAL slices of immutable
  strings (content.html / content.text).
  All coordinates normalized [0,1], origin
  top-left; polygons are closed point rings.
  conf_stats = {n, sum, min, max, hist[10]} —
  additive, materialized bottom-up at write.
endlegend

enum ExtractionStatus {
  PENDING
  RUNNING
  SUCCEEDED
  PARTIAL
  FAILED
}

enum StructureSource {
  EMBEDDED
  DETECTED
  CURATED
}

class Blob <<Model>> {
  id : UUIDField <<PK>>
  sha256 : CharField(64)
  size : BigIntegerField
  mime_type : CharField(100)
  file : FileField
  created_at : DateTimeField
  .. constraints ..
  unique: sha256
  .. semantics ..
  immutable, content-addressed;
  originals AND derived artifacts
  (thumbnails, raw extractor output)
}

class Document <<Model>> {
  id : UUIDField <<PK>>
  title : CharField(500)
  meta : JSONField
  created_at : DateTimeField
  .. facade — the public interface ..
  text : str
  html : str
  pages : QuerySet[Page]
  outline() : list[Node]
  hit(page_no, x, y) : Node
  confidence(measure) : float | Histogram
  reextract(extractor) : DocumentContent
  .. invariants ..
  clean(): current_content.is_current
  and current_content.document == self
}

class Extractor <<Model>> {
  id : BigAutoField <<PK>>
  name : CharField(100)
  version : CharField(50)
  config : JSONField
  .. constraints ..
  unique: (name, version)
}

package "Immutable content snapshot" #FBF9F4 {

  class DocumentContent <<Model>> {
    id : UUIDField <<PK>>
    status : ExtractionStatus = PENDING
    is_current : BooleanField = False
    html : TextField
    text : TextField
    conf_stats : JSONField (null)
    stats : JSONField
    error : TextField
    started_at : DateTimeField (null)
    finished_at : DateTimeField (null)
    created_at : DateTimeField
    .. constraints ..
    partial unique: (document) where is_current
    FTS index on text
    .. api ..
    outline() : list[Node]
    node(nid) : Node
    diff(other : DocumentContent) : ContentDiff
    .. managers ..
    successful(): filter(status=SUCCEEDED)
  }

  class Page <<Model>> {
    number : PositiveIntegerField
    label : CharField(20) (null)
    width : FloatField (null)
    height : FloatField (null)
    conf_stats : JSONField (null)
    meta : JSONField
    .. constraints ..
    unique: (content, number)
    .. api ..
    reduced_html() : str
    text() : str
    hit(x, y) : Node
  }

  class Node <<Model>> {
    nid : PositiveIntegerField
    path : CharField(255)
    order : PositiveIntegerField
    tag : CharField(20)
    level : PositiveSmallIntegerField (null)
    title : CharField(1000) (null)
    source : StructureSource
    conf_stats : JSONField (null)
    html_start : IntegerField
    html_end : IntegerField
    text_start : IntegerField
    text_end : IntegerField
    .. constraints ..
    unique: (content, nid)
    index: (content, path)
    index: (content, text_start)
    index: (content, tag)
    .. api ..
    html() : str
    text() : str
    subtree() : QuerySet[Node]
    regions() : list[(Page, polygon | envelope)]
    conf(measure) : float | Histogram
  }

  class PageRegion <<Model>> {
    x0, y0, x1, y1 : FloatField
    polygon : JSONField (null)
    words : JSONField (null)
    conf_stats : JSONField (null)
    detect_conf : FloatField (null)
    order : PositiveIntegerField
    text_start : IntegerField (null)
    text_end : IntegerField (null)
    .. constraints ..
    index: (page)
    index: (node)
    .. semantics ..
    x0..y1 = axis-aligned envelope,
    derived from polygon at write time
  }
}

' ---------- relations (each solid/diamond edge is a ForeignKey column) ----------

' layout only: park shared infrastructure outside the aggregate
Blob -[hidden]down- Extractor

Document "0..*" --> "1" Blob : source_blob\n<<PROTECT>>
Document "0..*" ..> "0..1" Blob : thumbnail\n<<SET_NULL>>
Document "1" *-- "0..*" DocumentContent : contents (full history)\n<<CASCADE>>
Document "0..1" ..> "0..1" DocumentContent : current_content\n<<SET_NULL>>
DocumentContent "0..*" --> "1" Blob : blob (pinned input bytes)\n<<PROTECT>>
DocumentContent "0..*" ..> "0..1" Blob : raw_output (extractor-native JSON)\n<<SET_NULL>>
DocumentContent "0..*" --> "1" Extractor : extractor\n<<PROTECT>>
DocumentContent "1" *-- "0..*" Page : pages\n<<CASCADE>>
DocumentContent "1" *-- "0..*" Node : nodes\n<<CASCADE>>
Node "0..1" *-- "0..*" Node : parent ▸ children\n<<CASCADE>>
Node "1" *-- "0..*" PageRegion : regions\n<<CASCADE>>
Page "1" *-- "0..*" PageRegion : regions\n<<CASCADE>>
Page "0..*" ..> "0..1" Blob : thumbnail\n<<SET_NULL>>

' ---------- notes ----------

note bottom of Document
  **Aggregate-root facade**: text / html /
  pages / outline() / hit() / confidence()
  delegate to current_content — content rows
  never leak into the public interface.
end note

note right of DocumentContent
  **html is THE artifact**: one sanitized,
  semantically correct HTML document. Every
  structural tag carries data-nid AND
  data-pages="12,13" — derived values burned
  into an immutable artifact cannot drift,
  and the exported HTML stays self-contained
  (page badges, citations, jump-to-page).
  text is the plain projection + FTS index.
  --
  Lifecycle as established: new extractor ⇒
  new snapshot ⇒ fresh rows, immutable after
  commit; is_current + partial unique index
  is the DB-enforced "current"; both it and
  the pointer flip in one transaction.
  --
  **Ops, not schema**: prune old non-current
  snapshots, GC blobs no FK references.
end note

note right of Node
  **SQL index into the one true HTML** —
  one row per data-nid tag.
  **The type IS the html tag**
  (p, h2, table, figure,
  section, li, …): the sanitizer's tag
  allowlist is the vocabulary, so there is
  no enum to migrate. level = semantic level
  (h1..h6, section depth) — tree depth stays
  derivable from path. subtree = path LIKE
  'prefix%'; html_start/html_end slice the
  node's outerHTML out of content.html —
  subtree extraction is a string slice.
end note

note bottom of PageRegion
  **Two-tier geometry** (Textract / PAGE-XML
  pattern): polygon is the truth — normalized
  closed ring, handles rotation and skew;
  the envelope is derived for plain indexed
  SQL. hit() = envelope filter in the DB,
  point-in-polygon refine in Python,
  smallest area wins. polygon NULL ⇒ region
  IS the envelope. words: [[x0,y0,x1,y1,
  text_start,text_end,conf], …] — offsets
  global into content.text, within the
  owning node's range.
  (PostGIS = escape hatch if geometry ever
  gets heavy.)
end note

note as CONF #EDF3EC
  **Confidence: stored once, aggregated everywhere.**
  Ground truth = per-word conf
  inside words. conf_stats {n, sum, min, max,
  hist[10]} is materialized bottom-up at
  write: region → node (whole subtree) →
  page → content. Histograms are ADDITIVE,
  so every rollup is a sum; mean = sum/n;
  the READER picks the measure — exact
  percentiles by scanning words. Click a
  word = hit the region, scan its words.
  detect_conf is a different quantity: the
  layout model's belief in the region itself
  — never mix it into text-quality rollups.
  Born-digital input ⇒ NULL, never fake 1.0.
end note

CONF .. PageRegion
CONF .. Node

note as STD #EDF3EC
  **Boring by construction** — same concepts,
  SQL clothes: content.html ≈ hOCR; Node ≈
  Tagged-PDF structure tree / docling items;
  PageRegion ≈ PAGE-XML region / ALTO zone /
  docling prov (page, bbox, charspan).
  raw_output keeps the extractor's native
  payload — schema changes re-project from it
  without paying for OCR again.
end note

STD .. DocumentContent

@enduml
